TranslationUnitDecl
|-ClassTemplateDecl A
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl class depth 0 index 0 T
| |-NonTypeTemplateParmDecl 'bool' depth 0 index 1 B
| `-CXXRecordDecl struct A definition
`-ClassTemplateDecl C
  |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
  `-CXXRecordDecl struct C definition
    |-FieldDecl x 'A<T, (3 > 2)>'
    `-FieldDecl y 'A<T, (sizeof(T) > 1)>'
